sequenceDiagram
  participant Main as ESP32-S3
  participant HMI as DWIN HMI
  participant Cam as ESP32-CAM peer
  Main->>HMI: UART1 115200 8N1; page/VP writes
  HMI-->>Main: UART frame; button byte at offset 8
  Main->>Cam: ESP-NOW CommandMessage START
  loop Until three messages
    Cam-->>Main: ESP-NOW PredictionMessage (expected)
  end
  Main->>Cam: ESP-NOW CommandMessage STOP
  Note over Cam: Camera implementation and protocol compatibility are not present for verification
